OL,3,APutin says Russia, US, and China share
OL,4,A'joint responsibility' for global peace
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier, Trump held separate, bilateral
OL,7,Fmeetings with Putin and Xi. He called
OL,8,FPutin his friend - watch the moment
OL,9,Fhere
OL,11,FAfter meeting Xi, Trump said the US and
OL,12,FChina want to see an end to the Ukraine
OL,13,Fwar
